      "writtenOn": "2025-11-18T20:49:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I decided to just keep it as a single check incorporating an arbitrary number of solutions without setting the project commit. Instead, everything shows up as a mount.\n\nI\u0027m pretty sure that I\u0027ve encountered a builder that checked out a repo to some nested directory where the DEPS file would add dependencies not within that directory (e.g. builder checks out repo X to src/X and the DEPS file would have entries for src and src/Y).",
