      "message": "this is unfortunate; @tbain@google.com do you remember why this was done for branch? This means you cannot represent CLs for anything outside of refs/heads now (e.g. refs/branch-heads/* cannot be represented in GerritChangeInfo).\n\nI remember asking that ref include refs/heads for gob sources, but I must have missed this for gerrit changes",
