      "message": "This matches the ChangeInfo from Gerrit\u0027s API: https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/Documentation/rest-api-changes.html#change-info\n\nThe branch for refs outside of refs/heads shows up as the ref: https://screenshot.googleplex.com/47hPozdAyhgiav2",
